WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.332
The last value function can be confusing because it works inside the current window frame.

00:00:05.332 --> 00:00:10.882
Many students expect it to automatically return the final value in the entire partition.

00:00:10.882 --> 00:00:17.218
But if the current frame ends at the current row, the last value may simply be the current row's value.

00:00:17.725 --> 00:00:24.887
If you truly want the final value for the entire group, the frame must extend through the end of that partition.

00:00:24.887 --> 00:00:30.297
The key lesson is that a window function name does not tell you the whole story.

00:00:30.297 --> 00:00:32.739
The frame is part of the calculation.
